  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Egypt Kigali Implementation Plan to Phase down hydrofluorocarbons (HFCs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to develop an overarching strategy for Egypt to meet its obligations under the Kigali Amendment for the phase-down of HFCs. The key activities will include data collection, analysis, stakeholder consultations, strategy development, and finalization of a detailed project document for Stage I of the HFC phase-down plan for Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
